00:36:25.840 --> 00:36:31.231
Stitcher, or wherever you get your audio.
AND, please please, if you are a fan of the

00:36:31.231 --> 00:36:37.650
show, show us some love! Give us five stars
and leave a review on Apple podcasts. It means

00:36:37.650 --> 00:36:43.000
so much to us and it helps us get noticed.
